1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:01:42,729 --> 00:01:47,990
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:51,020
[Episode 27]

4
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,920
Where's your breakfast?

5
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,470
Here.

6
00:02:27,810 --> 00:02:29,540
You haven't even opened the packaging.

7
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:30,230
Have you been drinking coffee

8
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:32,030
on an empty stomach all morning?

9
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,380
Actually, I...

10
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,630
Yeah.

11
00:02:42,210 --> 00:02:43,810
Last time we went to the cafe,

12
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:44,740
you didn't even take a bite

13
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:46,090
of the cake you ordered.

14
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:48,750
Now you've been up all night working,

15
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:51,410
and you're drinking coffee
on an empty stomach?

16
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,210
I wouldn't dare.

17
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:01,900
I wouldn't dare.

18
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,480
Let me ask you something.

19
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,540
I'm angry right now.

20
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,150
How should I lose my temper?

21
00:03:10,630 --> 00:03:11,580
I get to decide?

22
00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:14,800
I'll take your opinion into consideration.

23
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:19,070
My opinion...

24
00:03:23,930 --> 00:03:24,810
Give me a kiss.

25
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:26,829
A kiss will calm you down.

26
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,810
You made me angry,

27
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:30,930
and you want me to kiss you?

28
00:03:30,930 --> 00:03:32,370
Isn't that too much?

29
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:33,680
I can kiss you too.

30
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,110
I meant right here!

31
00:03:56,950 --> 00:03:57,610
Alright,

32
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:58,570
don't be mad.

33
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:00,280
I was wrong.

34
00:04:01,180 --> 00:04:01,970
I was wrong.

35
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,780
You admit your mistakes pretty quickly.

36
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:07,870
Then promise me,

37
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,800
no more coffee on an empty stomach.

38
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:11,240
Okay.

39
00:04:11,530 --> 00:04:12,530
Don't just say it,

40
00:04:12,530 --> 00:04:13,840
keep it in mind.

41
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:16,740
Okay.

42
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:17,950
Okay.

43
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,510
Just another "okay."

44
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,930
Okay, okay.

45
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,120
Um,

46
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,480
I have something to tell you.

47
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,470
Sit down.

48
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,480
What's wrong?

49
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:39,730
In a while,

50
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:42,030
I have to go on a business trip to EAW.

51
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,580
I'll be going back for a while.

52
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,220
Okay,

53
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:47,570
then I'll go with you.

54
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,310
Don't you have a paper to write?

55
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:51,630
I can go by myself.

56
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,630
Can't I go?

57
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,930
I'll be busy with work too,

58
00:04:57,930 --> 00:05:00,530
and I'm afraid
I won't be able to look after you.

59
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,270
Alright,

60
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,400
then I'll wait for you at home.

61
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:06,480
Okay.

62
00:05:16,350 --> 00:05:17,160
Mrs. Jiang.

63
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:18,310
What's wrong?

64
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,190
Shize,

65
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,170
why did you send us money again?

66
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:22,840
Didn't I tell you

67
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,980
not to send us money anymore?

68
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,920
I know you mean well.

69
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:28,770
Now that Grandma is gone,

70
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,200
my husband and I

71
00:05:30,230 --> 00:05:31,960
can manage just fine on our own.

72
00:05:32,210 --> 00:05:34,420
You don't need to worry about us anymore.

73
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:34,930
Okay.

74
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,880
I understand, Ms. Jiang.

75
00:05:37,990 --> 00:05:39,340
If you need anything,

76
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:40,800
just let me know anytime.

77
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,500
Okay.

78
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:47,070
What's wrong?

79
00:05:48,370 --> 00:05:49,820
What happened?

80
00:05:50,290 --> 00:05:51,790
Tell me about it.

81
00:05:53,659 --> 00:05:54,370
It's nothing.

82
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:55,240
Mrs. Jiang

83
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,530
told me not to

84
00:05:56,630 --> 00:05:58,030
send money home anymore.

85
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:01,320
Have you been
sending them money all along?

86
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:02,370
Yeah.

87
00:06:03,300 --> 00:06:04,220
I think Yuan's death

88
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,220
was because of me.

89
00:06:05,810 --> 00:06:07,140
After Yuan passed away,

90
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,240
I thought I should

91
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,840
take good care of his family.

92
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,180
Do you still go see them?

93
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:17,630
I used to visit them often

94
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:19,870
because Grandma was very fond of me.

95
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,790
But after Grandma passed away,

96
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:22,980
I thought I shouldn't

97
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:24,180
bother them anymore.

98
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:26,000
Why not?

99
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,980
When they see me,

100
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:32,330
they'll think of Yuan.

101
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:35,690
They'll remember that he's gone

102
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:37,890
because of me.

103
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:39,870
I know in their hearts,

104
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:40,720
they blame me.

105
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:42,890
It's not your fault.

106
00:06:48,470 --> 00:06:49,470
I think things are

107
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:51,040
pretty good as they are now.

108
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,270
It's been so long.

109
00:06:55,990 --> 00:06:57,930
You shouldn't overthink it.

110
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,040
Time will heal everything.

111
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,130
Yeah.

112
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:19,120
Welcome.

113
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,810
What are you doing here?

114
00:07:30,130 --> 00:07:30,980
Welcome.

115
00:07:34,580 --> 00:07:35,700
What are you up to?

116
00:07:36,930 --> 00:07:38,270
It's called a work-study plan.

117
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:38,930
Look,

118
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:40,200
I can study for my master's,

119
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,110
keep you company,

120
00:07:41,110 --> 00:07:42,120
and make money at the same time.

121
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,920
Kill three birds with one stone.

122
00:07:45,540 --> 00:07:47,940
I think you're just here
to keep an eye on me.

123
00:07:48,890 --> 00:07:50,390
Strictly speaking,

124
00:07:50,420 --> 00:07:52,100
I'm your boss now.

125
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,040
I could fire you right now,

126
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,040
believe it or not.

127
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,540
Boss,

128
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,980
if you don't clock in soon,

129
00:07:56,980 --> 00:07:57,840
you'll be late.

130
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:01,880
I'll deal with you after work.

131
00:08:04,930 --> 00:08:06,720
We'll see who deals with whom.

132
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:12,770
Kitty.

133
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,420
Kitty.

134
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,610
Where's Rainie?

135
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:19,680
I hadn't seen it since before

136
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,810
I came back to Xifu.

137
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:24,570
If it's somewhere else now,

138
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:25,420
what if there's no one

139
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:26,620
there to feed it?

140
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:29,270
Could it have been taken by someone?

141
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:30,930
If I had known,

142
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,610
I would have taken it home.

143
00:08:34,169 --> 00:08:35,620
Maybe no one took it.

144
00:08:36,409 --> 00:08:37,250
Perhaps

145
00:08:38,250 --> 00:08:38,909
it found someone

146
00:08:38,909 --> 00:08:40,270
as kind-hearted as you

147
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:41,500
who adopted it.

148
00:08:43,010 --> 00:08:43,820
Maybe it's already enjoying

149
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,000
its happy cat life.

150
00:08:45,670 --> 00:08:47,270
What if none of that is true?

151
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,310
Then I believe

152
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,840
it will, like you,

153
00:08:52,410 --> 00:08:53,390
come back to me.

154
00:09:34,650 --> 00:09:35,850
It's been a year.

155
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:38,170
Why does the house look exactly the same?

156
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:42,400
I knew that one day,

157
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,370
I would bring you back here.

158
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:47,940
Fu Shize,

159
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:49,870
aren't you a little too confident?

160
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,470
Didn't I bring you back?

161
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,320
There are only 2 pieces left.

162
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,980
Aren't you going to finish it?

163
00:10:22,610 --> 00:10:24,070
Let's finish it together.

164
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:26,150
So you were

165
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:29,190
waiting for me to come back
and finish it with you?

166
00:10:46,630 --> 00:10:48,890
I have to go out in a bit.

167
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:51,480
I'm meeting my advisor for a chat.

168
00:10:51,940 --> 00:10:53,140
Need me to come along?

169
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:54,010
No need.

170
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,810
Just lend me your car.

171
00:10:56,450 --> 00:10:57,070
As for you,

172
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:57,710
just stay at home

173
00:10:57,710 --> 00:10:59,240
and wait for me to come back.

174
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,740
Then drive safely.

175
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,820
My dad works at a driving school.

176
00:11:06,820 --> 00:11:07,770
I've been influenced by him
since I was a kid.

177
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:08,740
I'm super good.

178
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:11,440
Okay.

179
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:12,660
Really.

180
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:15,100
I-I'm the driving queen of Xifu!

181
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,940
Next time, just call,

182
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:28,340
and I'll have Jiang deliver it to you.

183
00:11:28,340 --> 00:11:29,240
Okay.

184
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:30,480
Goodbye.

185
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:32,720
Miss, what would you like to buy?

186
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,980
Come in and take a look.

187
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,190
Hello, Auntie.

188
00:11:35,410 --> 00:11:37,480
I'm Jiang Yuan's classmate.

189
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,250
I spoke to you

190
00:11:38,250 --> 00:11:39,750
on the phone before.

191
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:42,390
It's you.

192
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:45,340
Jiang.

193
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,340
Yuan's classmate is here.

194
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:48,140
Hello, Uncle.

195
00:11:48,310 --> 00:11:49,000
Thank you.

196
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:51,670
Please sit.

197
00:11:53,130 --> 00:11:54,600
It's been a long time since

198
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,130
Yuan's classmate visited.

199
00:11:56,530 --> 00:11:57,670
This is a gift

200
00:11:57,670 --> 00:11:58,650
for you and Auntie.

201
00:11:58,650 --> 00:11:59,270
Thank you.

202
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:00,600
Here,

203
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:01,270
have some water.

204
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:02,330
Thank you, Auntie.

205
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,270
Uncle, Auntie,

206
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:07,080
how have you been?

207
00:12:07,770 --> 00:12:09,370
We've been doing quite well.

208
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:11,120
Isn't life just like this?

209
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,190
We're living it day by day.

210
00:12:13,410 --> 00:12:14,980
When we miss our son,

211
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:16,200
we just go over

212
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,510
and take a look in his room.

213
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:18,320
Auntie,

214
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,170
may I go in and take a look?

215
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:21,130
Sure.

216
00:12:22,940 --> 00:12:24,240
Come on.

217
00:12:24,530 --> 00:12:25,340
Come in.

218
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:30,070
Feel free to look around.

219
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:40,200
That's his best friend.

220
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,170
They grew up together.

221
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,910
May I take a look at these books?

222
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:48,870
Yes,

223
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:50,080
feel free to look.

224
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:00,530
These are diaries

225
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:01,860
he wrote in high school.

226
00:13:01,940 --> 00:13:02,740
Did he stop writing

227
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:03,980
since college?

228
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:06,360
During college...

229
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:08,010
His dad and I brought back

230
00:13:08,010 --> 00:13:09,820
everything from his dorm.

231
00:13:10,130 --> 00:13:11,370
We didn't see

232
00:13:11,370 --> 00:13:13,220
any diaries he wrote in college.

233
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,270
Did he have a computer?

234
00:13:19,700 --> 00:13:20,510
Yes,

235
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:22,030
it's in the drawer.

236
00:13:22,410 --> 00:13:23,470
I'll get it for you.

237
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:27,760
This was his computer.

238
00:13:33,650 --> 00:13:34,460
Oh,

239
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:35,650
that's the medal Yuan won

240
00:13:35,650 --> 00:13:36,980
when he was part of

241
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:37,910
the drone team.

242
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:38,650
You know what?

243
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:39,910
The team he was in

244
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:41,200
won several championships.

245
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,120
Look at

246
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,630
these trophies

247
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:45,550
and medals.

248
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:48,030
Every time he came home,
he'd wipe them down

249
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:50,030
one by one until they were spotless.

250
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:51,880
He treasured them dearly.

251
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,270
Auntie,

252
00:13:59,290 --> 00:14:00,270
can I help

253
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:01,220
look for it together?

254
00:14:01,220 --> 00:14:02,030
Maybe we can find

255
00:14:02,030 --> 00:14:03,240
his diary from college.

256
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,010
Okay.

257
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:05,840
You can sit here.

258
00:14:06,490 --> 00:14:07,150
Have a seat.

259
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:09,440
Call me if you need anything.

260
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:09,860
Okay.

261
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:10,320
Take your time.

262
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,380
Thank you, Auntie.

263
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:30,900
Uncle, Auntie,

264
00:14:31,130 --> 00:14:31,820
could I take this USB drive

265
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:33,370
home to make a copy?

266
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:33,960
I'll

267
00:14:33,990 --> 00:14:36,390
explain everything to you in detail later.

268
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:38,320
Sure.

269
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:58,960
Lili,

270
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,810
why aren't you back yet?

271
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:03,360
Shize,

272
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,620
actually,

273
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:07,020
I didn't go to NUST
to meet my advisor today.

274
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,960
I went somewhere else.

275
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,330
You went to Jiang Yuan's house?

276
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,100
Yes.

277
00:15:13,690 --> 00:15:15,500
I went to see Uncle and Auntie

278
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,790
and found Jiang Yuan's

279
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:18,920
last diary entries.

280
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:21,250
Are you okay?

281
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,280
Did Uncle and Auntie

282
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:24,720
make things difficult for you?

283
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,050
They were very nice to me

284
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:29,100
and told me a lot of their true feelings.

285
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:31,790
Are you outside?

286
00:15:32,290 --> 00:15:32,860
Yes.

287
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,120
Wait for me there.

288
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:36,210
I'll come find you.

289
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,120
Shize,

290
00:15:54,190 --> 00:15:55,760
have you read the diary

291
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:56,860
Jiang Yuan wrote

292
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:58,180
in his last few years?

293
00:16:01,470 --> 00:16:01,920
No.

294
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,880
After his freshman year,

295
00:16:05,390 --> 00:16:06,620
he stopped writing.

296
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:14,080
I saved a copy to my phone.

297
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:15,640
I just sent it to you.

